###Mapping
Mapping test::emeraldestuary2::mapping::SiteReferenceMapping
(
  *test::emeraldestuary2::domain::SurveySite[site]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::emeraldestuary2::store::EstuaryStore]siteref.survey_site.site_code
    )
    ~mainTable [test::emeraldestuary2::store::EstuaryStore]siteref.survey_site
    siteCode: [test::emeraldestuary2::store::EstuaryStore]siteref.survey_site.site_code,
    siteName: [test::emeraldestuary2::store::EstuaryStore]siteref.survey_site.site_name,
    regionName: [test::emeraldestuary2::store::EstuaryStore]siteref.survey_site.region_name
  }
)
